1. Dedicate to the public use forever all applicable streets, roads, rights-of-way, water lines, sanitary sewer lines, stormwater facilities, fire hydrants, sidewalks, and public utility easements as shown hereon.
2. Grant the City of Winder full rights of access to said public facilities and easements for maintenance, service, and improvements.
3. Acknowledge that all public infrastructure improvements shall be maintained by the developer until final acceptance by the City, and are subject to a minimum two (2) year maintenance and warranty period or 90% of home completion; whichever comes last, from the date of final plat approval and execution of the maintenance agreement.
4. Acknowledges that said infrastructure is dedicated at time of final plat to public use forever and will become the responsibility of the City for operation.
5. Declare that all other improvements not specifically dedicated are private and shall remain the responsibility of the developer, homeowner association, or property owners, as applicable.
